## Issue #7: Agent Installation and Enrollment
**Date:** November 17, 2025  
**Phase:** Phase 2 - Kali Agent Deployment

#### Problem Description
After resolving network issues, encountered duplicate agent name error preventing new agent enrollment.

**Symptoms:**
